ss=8&oh=00_AfwkPtmO4skE9bBIbLIUqzLBNLFAQOJVEZlOf8Sbx_oAXQ&oe=69C14367"}, {"file_name": "peek.png", "id": "1009464856621649", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_1009464859954982_7090744758627338677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ICnDcb3200AQ7kNvwELtRZA&_nc_oc=Ado4wqZghXC9gtgY-A6GlB3fyJzxiVmKnJIvhgpp-r9RJ3ISvKZ4BPRiknvFegWlLMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw1ejGw89tLNaIadC568Y_d21qkL3hACg0Tkf_BFDVuJg&oe=69C127DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "banner.png", "id": "636604377435150", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003244_636604380768483_6976895474501699949_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l7HtJdegE4QQ7kNvwEol97S&_nc_oc=AdoQCUvjcsO9-lifGjmYqEub84xGxr0xTZpCYvyVLt7l4lIE1zeWMPXH6xcUQKtjjho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyLMrJQZ4Jm8Ta5yIEoY3DUIMEVZg_pzoDVu6S2WUp0NQ&oe=69C122B6"}, "display_name": "Puppet VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Puppet VR is like a virtual puppet theater. Pick a bunny, make a recording, repeat. Improvise a funny scene, or have conversations with yourself!\n\n**Features**\n- 4 space bunnies, controlled by YOU\n- Record your voice, movement, or both\n- Play back your recordings - all 4 at the same time\n- Play in Quest Standalone - no wires needed\n\n**Your creativity's the limit!**\n- Create funny scenes, with yourself from the past\n- Go a capella, and make the bunnies sing\n- Host a bunny dance party\n- ... And more!\n\nPuppet VR is currently in development", "short_description": "A virtual puppet theater where every actor is YOU!\n\nControl up to 4 bunnies at the same time, and use them to make a movie, sing a song or host a dance party - your creativity is the limit!"}]}, "developer_name": "Daniel Tauritis", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/puppet-vr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publis